 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? A good starting point is a set of light weight dumbbells. A set of two or three weights from ten to fifteen pounds is perfect. For morning runs, a small bag with a quick energy bar and a few apple slices is fine. A simple digital watch is fine, but running with a phone in your pocket can be dangerous if you stop and take it out. A headlamp and a pair of thin gloves are worth having. Light or thin socks are fine, but thick ones can cause blisters.",
